AMS-GRA GigE MEL Provider

This repository includes unmodified declarations from the open-arsenal
IR MEL, Common MEL, and AMS Math projects. Their original copyright,
Apache-2.0 license, and INTENT.md notices are retained in third_party/.
Source revisions and per-file provenance are recorded in
third_party/manifest.json and docs/upstream-provenance.md.

The federal-government copyright statements in those dependencies describe
their upstream materials, not the newly authored provider implementation.

This distribution also uses nlohmann/json 3.12.0, Copyright (c) 2013-2025
Niels Lohmann, under the MIT license retained in
third_party/nlohmann-json/LICENSE.MIT. Its private parser source identity and
integrity hashes are recorded in third_party/json-manifest.json.

The optional, uninstalled GIGE_MEL_BUILD_ARAVIS targets dynamically link the
Aravis 0.8.36 library (LGPL-2.1-or-later, https://github.com/AravisProject/aravis)
when a developer explicitly provisions it. No Aravis source or binary is
included in this repository or in the installed package.
